      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I\u2019ve been stuck on this island for a while now.\\n\r\nI\u2019m sure
    the lighthouse can send a signal, but I don\u2019t know the right code.\\n\r\nThe
    controls are in the house below. I\u2019ve tried pressing the buttons, but I
    can\u2019t figure it out.\\n\r\nI found this riddle near the mechanism. I think
    the answer is the message I need to send.\r\n"
